TUPLE
- Ordered collection
- Created using ()
- Immutable
- Indexed and iterable
- Allows duplicates

Tuple Operations:
+  Concatenation
*  Repetition
Indexing
Slicing
in / not in

Tuple Functions:
len()
max()
min()
sum()
sorted()
tuple()
any()
all()

Tuple Methods:
count()
index()

Tuple Concepts:
- Tuple Packing
- Tuple Unpacking
- Nested Tuples
- Immutability

LIST vs TUPLE
List   → Mutable, [ ]
Tuple  → Immutable, ( )